FreeCAD Transaction Guard

Derived from the Neutron 101 project's Forma/bridge.py transaction wrapper,
which carries SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later. The original fix was
the removal of nested transaction management from Forma/edge_ops.py. This
standalone extraction adds application-level ownership checks, fail-closed
recovery, explicit callback contracts and native regression tests.

The implementation and tests in this package are distributed under
LGPL-2.1-or-later. See COPYING.LESSER and COPYING. License texts are reproduced
unchanged from FreeCAD's bundled AddonManager license resources.

FreeCAD and Open CASCADE Technology are separate upstream projects. Their
binaries and implementation source are not included here. This package is not
an upstream FreeCAD/OCCT patch and does not imply endorsement by those projects.
No proprietary CAD code, user models, credentials or model weights are included.
